WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:32.444
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:32.714 --> 00:36.919
But hey, if that gets on my clothes...

3
00:47.652 --> 00:49.693
School is peaceful.

4
00:51.515 --> 00:54.908
As if nothing ever happened.

5
00:57.412 --> 01:00.826
Are you crazy? Are you crazy? Are you crazy?

6
01:00.826 --> 01:03.460
What is wrong with you?

7
01:03.460 --> 01:06.490
Why won't you ever listen? Seriously!

8
01:06.490 --> 01:09.744
Mom and Dad, too.

9
01:09.744 --> 01:12.386
Jung Yeon.

10
01:12.386 --> 01:13.439
Everyone's the same.

11
01:13.439 --> 01:15.784
Are you okay? Are you all right?

12
01:15.784 --> 01:17.659
Oh my. What do I do?

13
01:17.659 --> 01:19.559
Seriously.

14
01:19.559 --> 01:24.064
Honestly, Kim Ha Yeon! Really. Seriously.

15
01:24.064 --> 01:25.467
Let's go now.

16
01:25.467 --> 01:27.747
Jung Yeon.

17
01:27.747 --> 01:29.421
Oh, no.

18
01:43.208 --> 01:45.377
Go, Ha Yeon. Go on ahead.

19
01:45.377 --> 01:46.878
Damn it.

20
01:46.878 --> 01:48.811
Ha Yeon, go!

21
01:50.715 --> 01:52.694
But subtly,

22
01:53.855 --> 01:57.111
so very subtly.

23
01:58.974 --> 02:04.146
Sorry, what is it? What? Let me look. Just show me once.

24
02:04.146 --> 02:07.733
No. No. I said no.

25
02:10.094 --> 02:11.094
Sorry.

26
02:11.903 --> 02:13.210
I'm really sorry.

27
02:13.864 --> 02:15.204
Seriously.

28
02:16.366 --> 02:17.558
Sorry.

29
02:18.815 --> 02:21.689
- I really... - Doesn't matter. Follow me.

30
02:21.689 --> 02:24.675
- What's the harm in showing me once? - I said no.

31
02:24.675 --> 02:26.175
What? Sung Sae Ryeong?

32
02:26.175 --> 02:30.731
Right. So what happened exactly? Come on, tell us the story.

33
02:30.731 --> 02:33.147
You know that transfer student from Seoul?

34
02:33.147 --> 02:35.775
She fought Sung Sae Ryeong over Cho Yu Gyeom.

35
02:35.775 --> 02:37.637
No way. Is that true?

36
02:37.637 --> 02:39.639
But Sung Sae Ryeong got beaten to a pulp.

37
02:39.639 --> 02:44.815
That Seoul bitch is scary. I heard she was taken to the hospital.

38
02:45.422 --> 02:48.775
But you know Sung Sae Ryeong's family?

39
02:48.775 --> 02:52.815
She got hurt that badly, so isn't it weird that they're so quiet?

40
02:52.815 --> 02:57.240
Exactly. Normally they'd be raising hell by now, wouldn't they?

41
02:57.240 --> 03:00.452
Maybe the Seoul girl's family isn't ordinary.

42
03:00.452 --> 03:02.746
What does her family do, anyway?

43
03:02.746 --> 03:04.407
How would I know?

44
03:04.407 --> 03:07.704
It's a horror. This school is a horror.

45
03:09.415 --> 03:12.224
What? Was someone in there?

46
03:12.224 --> 03:13.775
It's not Sung Sae Ryeong, is it?

47
03:13.775 --> 03:17.301
Run! Hurry! Go, go!

48
03:25.775 --> 03:28.500
A tiny crack within it

49
03:29.898 --> 03:33.735
began to seep into our time.

50
03:33.735 --> 03:36.755
[4. A New World]

51
03:38.156 --> 03:39.950
[Episode 4]

52
03:39.950 --> 03:41.538
Raise your head.

53
03:49.084 --> 03:54.043
Jae Jin, you must live an upright life.

54
03:54.043 --> 03:55.497
Yes, Father.

55
03:57.008 --> 04:00.345
I hear Yu Gyeom was going out with a girl,

56
04:00.345 --> 04:04.748
then strayed to another girl, and that's how this mess began.

57
04:04.748 --> 04:08.645
Isn't this what you did 18 years ago?

58
04:08.645 --> 04:13.477
It's because you're that kind of man that Yu Gyeom did such a thing!

59
04:14.561 --> 04:16.325
I'm sorry, Father.

60
04:17.737 --> 04:23.027
Why is Yu Gyeom's mother standing there? Didn't I say to fetch Sae Ryeong's grandmother?

61
04:23.027 --> 04:24.518
Yes, Father.

62
04:29.374 --> 04:30.619
Oh, my.

63
04:31.668 --> 04:34.336
Sorry, sorry.

64
04:37.757 --> 04:40.468
No. Please, no. Ma'am,

65
04:40.468 --> 04:44.243
You have nothing to be sorry for.

66
04:44.243 --> 04:47.302
I'm the one who should apologize.

67
04:47.302 --> 04:51.506
My child hurt your precious granddaughter...

68
04:54.024 --> 04:57.414
Please, just take this for now.

69
05:00.780 --> 05:04.563
Ma'am, this isn't a matter of whether you accept it or not.

70
05:04.563 --> 05:07.704
It's only right that we give it to you.

71
05:07.704 --> 05:12.755
Sae Ryeong got hurt because of our child, after all.

72
05:12.755 --> 05:14.377
Here.

73
05:14.377 --> 05:18.382
It's fine. I don't need to take it.

74
05:21.885 --> 05:23.909
What is she saying?

75
05:25.235 --> 05:26.397
Um...

76
05:29.100 --> 05:32.099
You... Didn't you say you're taking sign language?

77
05:32.099 --> 05:33.757
This is sign language.

78
05:37.400 --> 05:38.724
Hold on.

79
05:43.239 --> 05:49.204
I can't write. I don't know Hangul.

80
05:51.748 --> 05:56.522
Ma'am, even so, this is...

81
05:56.522 --> 06:00.722
something you really must accept.

82
06:02.814 --> 06:07.522
No, it's fine. You paid the hospital bill. That's a lot of money, too.

83
06:13.311 --> 06:18.214
She says paying the hospital bill is enough. That was a lot of money, too.

84
06:21.986 --> 06:25.616
Excuse me. Tell her we can't do that.

85
06:25.616 --> 06:30.138
It's only right that we give her this money.

86
06:41.305 --> 06:45.419
She says thank you, but just take it back.

87
06:57.063 --> 06:59.274
Sae Ryeong, let's go.

88
06:59.274 --> 07:01.128
No. You guys go ahead.

89
07:02.569 --> 07:04.446
Cho Yu Gyeom?

90
07:04.446 --> 07:06.602
Fine, let's go.

91
07:13.163 --> 07:14.416
Hey...

92
07:17.265 --> 07:19.600
Is your head all right?

93
07:22.238 --> 07:24.811
I didn't mean to. I'm sorry.

94
07:26.510 --> 07:27.836
Get lost.

95
07:36.686 --> 07:37.987
Let's go.

96
07:37.987 --> 07:41.629
Sung Sae Ryeong, time to go home. You can't, can you?

97
07:41.629 --> 07:44.564
Dummy, dummy.

98
07:46.279 --> 07:49.608
Well, well, Cho Yu Gyeom.

99
07:49.608 --> 07:51.258
Did you see that earlier?

100
07:51.258 --> 07:54.574
How Goh Hui Jun made a real fool of himself?

101
07:54.574 --> 07:56.814
You told me to!

102
07:56.814 --> 07:57.874
Let's go.

103
07:57.874 --> 07:59.887
Sung Sae Ryeong's not here yet.

104
07:59.887 --> 08:01.771
Sae Ryeong!

105
08:01.771 --> 08:03.165
You don't need to call her.

106
08:03.165 --> 08:04.714
Why not? Hey!

107
08:04.714 --> 08:06.171
We broke up.

108
08:08.885 --> 08:09.930
What?

109
08:11.425 --> 08:14.983
I said Sung Sae Ryeong and I broke up.

110
08:16.017 --> 08:17.727
If you're not coming, I'm going ahead.

111
08:17.727 --> 08:19.667
Cho Yu Gyeom!

112
08:19.667 --> 08:22.149
Give me more details!

113
08:22.149 --> 08:24.388
What are you talking about?

114
08:28.825 --> 08:32.075
- Did they really break up? - I heard they really did.

115
08:32.075 --> 08:34.272
Really?

116
08:34.272 --> 08:35.314
Stop it.

117
08:35.314 --> 08:37.647
That means it's really over, right?

118
08:37.647 --> 08:39.964
Here you go, ma'am.

119
08:39.964 --> 08:44.456
Ma'am, if your granddaughter's wound gets worse or anything...

120
08:46.214 --> 08:50.131
Yes, I'm so sorry.

121
08:51.803 --> 08:53.096
Thank you.

122
08:53.096 --> 08:54.473
Let's go.

123
08:59.309 --> 09:04.835
You said you were taking a sign language class, so I thought you'd be good at it.

124
09:04.835 --> 09:06.025
What was that?

125
09:06.025 --> 09:07.924
Will that get you a good grade?

126
09:08.778 --> 09:10.354
I'd probably still get an A.

127
09:10.354 --> 09:11.823
Oh, my!

128
09:11.823 --> 09:14.225
What do you mean, an A?

129
09:14.225 --> 09:16.381
You should be getting an A+.

130
09:17.955 --> 09:19.247
Mom.

131
09:19.247 --> 09:21.105
What is it?

132
09:21.105 --> 09:22.483
You go on ahead.

133
09:22.483 --> 09:24.199
What? Why?

134
09:26.754 --> 09:30.194
Hey, Sae Ryeong and Yu Gyeom broke up!

135
09:30.194 --> 09:31.865
Don't be ridiculous.

136
09:31.865 --> 09:33.465
Yu Gyeom told me himself.

137
09:33.465 --> 09:34.689
Me too. I heard it too.

138
09:34.689 --> 09:37.766
He just came right out and said it. They broke up.

139
09:37.766 --> 09:39.054
Crazy!

140
09:39.054 --> 09:40.817
That's crazy.

141
10:24.605 --> 10:29.625
You didn't, did you? You didn't really break up, right?

142
10:29.625 --> 10:32.265
Come on, it makes no sense. It's all BS.

143
10:32.265 --> 10:35.376
Right? You just had a fight, right?

144
10:35.376 --> 10:37.966
Yeah. Fighting is part of growing up.

145
10:37.966 --> 10:40.286
Hey, you...

146
10:40.286 --> 10:43.864
Sae Ryeong got beaten up by that Seoul girl and was hospitalized.

147
10:43.864 --> 10:46.292
You really can't dump her.

148
10:46.292 --> 10:49.565
Hey, Cho Yu Gyeom! I'm serious!

149
10:49.565 --> 10:51.423
You didn't really break up, right?

150
10:51.423 --> 10:54.258
Won Bae, I told you, it's all a lie.

151
10:54.258 --> 10:57.011
Why would Yu Gyeom dump a girl like Sae Ryeong?

152
10:57.011 --> 10:58.961
Not unless he's really lost his mind.

153
11:00.669 --> 11:01.956
Goh Hui Jun.

154
11:01.956 --> 11:02.969
Yeah?

155
11:04.125 --> 11:05.630
I've lost my mind.

156
11:08.325 --> 11:10.566
I've really lost it.

157
11:10.566 --> 11:11.902
Let me out.

158
11:14.404 --> 11:17.782
What's he saying? Why's he getting off?

159
11:17.782 --> 11:19.319
I'll go ahead.

160
11:24.247 --> 11:25.535
Guys?

161
11:26.645 --> 11:29.377
What's with him? They didn't really break up, did they?

162
11:29.377 --> 11:32.105
Didn't he just say he lost his mind?

163
11:32.105 --> 11:34.882
Wait, isn't this Upo Country Club?

164
11:34.882 --> 11:38.692
Whoa! He's going to see that Seoul girl. She lives here, right?

165
11:38.692 --> 11:40.755
Hey, wait.

166
11:40.755 --> 11:45.230
You're really out of your mind. Go on, go!

167
11:58.212 --> 11:59.416
Excuse me.

168
12:04.705 --> 12:06.811
I wanted to ask you something.

169
12:09.375 --> 12:11.502
I'm not a bad person.

170
12:11.502 --> 12:13.508
No, that's not it.

171
12:15.149 --> 12:19.821
By any chance, that sign language thing...

172
12:19.821 --> 12:21.430
Do you tutor it, too?

173
12:21.430 --> 12:22.458
Sign language?

174
12:22.458 --> 12:23.557
Yes.

175
12:23.557 --> 12:26.199
I'm a college student, and I'd like to learn it.

176
12:31.105 --> 12:36.281
Well, you can just memorize sign language from books or videos, so--

177
12:36.281 --> 12:38.780
No, I mean signing as fast as you do.

178
12:38.780 --> 12:40.114
What?

179
12:40.114 --> 12:42.869
When you sign that fast, I can't follow at all.

180
12:42.869 --> 12:44.114
So...

181
12:45.809 --> 12:49.474
Then you could ask to slow it down--

182
12:49.474 --> 12:51.052
Do you have a phone?

183
12:53.149 --> 12:54.770
You do.

184
12:54.770 --> 12:56.197
010...

185
12:57.591 --> 12:59.801
- Could you type it in? - Okay.

186
12:59.801 --> 13:03.475
010-0711-9012.

187
13:03.475 --> 13:05.181
That's my number.

188
13:05.181 --> 13:10.295
Once or twice a week. Think of it as teaching English conversation.

189
13:10.295 --> 13:13.762
For the fee, how about 20,000 won an hour?

190
13:13.762 --> 13:16.337
Any time works, just not too early.

191
13:17.401 --> 13:19.501
Let me know if you're interested.

192
13:20.530 --> 13:21.645
Well, then.

193
13:33.349 --> 13:37.188
Miss, Madam's asking what's going on.

194
13:37.188 --> 13:38.930
It's nothing.

195
14:46.989 --> 14:49.120
How did you break up?

196
14:50.329 --> 14:54.756
You said you were scared of breaking up with Sung Sae Ryeong.

197
14:55.689 --> 15:00.934
I was afraid that if I broke up with Sae Ryeong, something would happen to her.

198
15:00.934 --> 15:02.926
That really scared me.

199
15:05.760 --> 15:07.757
But this time, I realized.

200
15:11.016 --> 15:12.572
Sae Ryeong, what...

201
15:14.019 --> 15:15.992
Did she die or something?

202
15:19.024 --> 15:22.189
I'm not scared of that anymore.

203
15:22.189 --> 15:27.528
Maybe now I don't even care what happens to Sae Ryeong.

204
15:28.408 --> 15:30.104
Yeah.

205
15:30.104 --> 15:31.830
I see.

206
15:32.955 --> 15:35.099
So I was able to break up.

207
15:41.049 --> 15:43.117
You know, Ha Yeon, that day...

208
15:44.715 --> 15:50.386
I got home and opened my bedroom door, and it smelled really good.

209
15:51.472 --> 15:54.946
It smelled so good that I just stayed in my room.

210
15:57.604 --> 16:00.486
Then my sister called me to eat, so I went out.

211
16:02.066 --> 16:05.897
Even when I was walking outside, I could still smell it.

212
16:08.156 --> 16:12.631
So I sniffed around and realized the smell was coming from my own hand.

213
16:23.609 --> 16:28.116
Your scent, on the hand that held yours.

214
16:32.469 --> 16:34.535
I liked that smell so much,

215
16:37.289 --> 16:39.002
I couldn't even wash my hand.

216
16:41.856 --> 16:44.234
Come on.

217
16:46.023 --> 16:47.622
Ha Yeon!

218
16:47.622 --> 16:48.622
Yeah?

219
16:49.281 --> 16:52.356
Can I hold your hand?

220
17:19.728 --> 17:21.979
Really? Is it true?

221
17:21.979 --> 17:24.725
Won Bae, is it true?

222
17:24.725 --> 17:29.269
I don't know, Your Highness. That bastard got off without saying a word, right?

223
17:29.269 --> 17:32.449
Can't you tell? This time it's for real.

224
17:33.199 --> 17:36.299
But have they ever broken up before?

225
17:36.299 --> 17:37.953
No, they haven't.

226
17:37.953 --> 17:40.199
Come to think of it, this is the first time.

227
17:40.199 --> 17:41.599
No way!

228
17:41.599 --> 17:43.125
That's insane!

229
17:43.125 --> 17:44.650
Really? For real?

230
17:44.650 --> 17:46.045
That's crazy.

231
17:46.045 --> 17:48.714
What do you guys keep saying is so crazy?

232
17:48.714 --> 17:50.849
You mean it's crazy they broke up?

233
17:50.849 --> 17:52.734
No, that's not what I meant.

234
17:52.734 --> 17:56.806
Even so, our young master Yu Gyeom goes straight to see that girl?

235
17:56.806 --> 17:59.518
They broke up, so he went to see her.

236
17:59.518 --> 18:03.014
You guys are shocked by everything. Crazy!

237
18:03.681 --> 18:04.688
So annoying.

238
18:04.688 --> 18:06.606
- Hey. - What?

239
18:07.689 --> 18:12.188
Won Bae, so are you coming or not? We've got nothing to do anyway.

240
18:12.188 --> 18:15.468
You guys always... You really love this stuff.

241
18:15.468 --> 18:16.579
Let's go.

242
18:17.201 --> 18:18.702
Not anymore.

243
18:18.702 --> 18:21.790
You going to the arcade, jerk?

244
18:21.790 --> 18:22.807
Bye.

245
18:25.126 --> 18:26.460
Jin Mi, what are you doing?

246
18:26.460 --> 18:27.897
What do you think?

247
18:27.897 --> 18:29.980
They really broke up.

248
18:31.355 --> 18:32.673
So what?

249
18:34.263 --> 18:37.632
Sung Sae Ryeong and Yu Gyeom are over for good.

250
18:58.139 --> 19:01.194
Please call me if anything happens.

251
19:01.194 --> 19:02.705
Ha Yeon's mom.

252
19:11.255 --> 19:12.981
Ma'am.

253
19:12.981 --> 19:18.399
With my deepest apologies, I've prepared this modest meal for you.

254
19:24.059 --> 19:28.938
Either way, because of our boy, your granddaughter went through so much.

255
19:28.938 --> 19:31.757
That's why I've invited you here.

256
19:37.773 --> 19:38.949
Thank you.

257
19:38.949 --> 19:42.897
But you didn't have to do this.

258
19:42.897 --> 19:45.457
Not at all. This is only right.

259
19:45.457 --> 19:47.497
This is a token of my sincerity.

260
19:47.497 --> 19:50.209
Please, eat.

261
20:07.688 --> 20:10.231
Did Sung Sae Ryeong really break up?

262
20:10.231 --> 20:12.243
Yeah, they say it's for real.

263
20:12.243 --> 20:15.028
Wrecked. Completely wrecked.

264
20:15.028 --> 20:16.578
What happened?

265
20:48.061 --> 20:49.962
Can't resist.

266
20:51.439 --> 20:52.668
Cheese for me.

267
20:53.692 --> 20:55.339
Hi.

268
20:55.339 --> 20:57.029
You're here.

269
20:57.029 --> 20:59.033
What? Is it for real?

270
20:59.656 --> 21:01.740
It's real. Why else would I call you?

271
21:01.740 --> 21:05.911
But Sung Sae Ryeong might be testing us,

272
21:05.911 --> 21:08.214
pretending to break up with Cho Yu Gyeom.

273
21:08.214 --> 21:11.459
If that's the case, we'll look like idiots.

274
21:11.459 --> 21:15.296
How many years have I been by Sung Sae Ryeong's side?

275
21:15.296 --> 21:17.590
Four years. Four.

276
21:17.590 --> 21:22.261
I've watched Sung Sae Ryeong and Cho Yu Gyeom from the very start until now.

277
21:22.261 --> 21:25.905
They've never broken up, not even as a joke.

278
21:25.905 --> 21:28.262
Least of all from Cho Yu Gyeom.

279
21:30.270 --> 21:32.650
Do you know what Cho Yu Gyeom said?

280
21:33.357 --> 21:36.342
"I'm crazy about some other bitch."

281
21:38.252 --> 21:39.585
So...

282
21:40.538 --> 21:42.105
what's your point?

283
21:43.365 --> 21:44.867
Well...

284
21:44.867 --> 21:49.306
If they broke up, they broke up. It's not like we can do anything.

285
21:49.306 --> 21:51.415
Of course we can.

286
21:51.415 --> 21:54.647
Have you forgotten everything Sung Sae Ryeong did to you?

287
21:54.647 --> 21:56.500
Lee Na Gyeong, for starters.

288
21:57.463 --> 22:02.051
Look at her. Just look at her. You're still like this? Still?

289
22:02.051 --> 22:04.485
And you guys, think about it.

290
22:04.485 --> 22:07.057
Were you okay with Sung Sae Ryeong going wild every night

291
22:07.057 --> 22:11.769
and summoning us to the group chat?

292
22:11.769 --> 22:14.810
Nobody even messes with a sleeping dog.

293
22:14.810 --> 22:19.068
But Sung Sae Ryeong calls us at 2 or 3 a.m. whenever she likes. And that's not all.

294
22:19.068 --> 22:22.452
But Kim Jin Mi, do you really have to go this far?

295
22:22.452 --> 22:25.658
You were her lackey.

296
22:25.658 --> 22:27.993
I think you're overstepping.

297
22:27.993 --> 22:31.914
And Sung Sae Ryeong's dad is a lawmaker.

298
22:31.914 --> 22:34.208
Even if she's lost Cho Yu Gyeom's backing.

299
22:34.208 --> 22:38.170
Right. Sung Sae Ryeong herself is no pushover.

300
22:38.170 --> 22:42.800
Kim Jin Mi, I think you're out of control...

301
22:42.800 --> 22:45.898
Thinking about Sung Sae Ryeong still scares me.

302
22:45.898 --> 22:47.315
Don't you feel it too?

303
22:48.064 --> 22:51.923
You know, I've met kids who are filthy rich,

304
22:51.923 --> 22:55.752
and kids so poor you'd gasp.

305
22:55.752 --> 22:59.566
But our dear Sae Ryeong said she's filthy rich, right?

306
22:59.566 --> 23:02.188
Right, she did.

307
23:02.188 --> 23:04.905
So why does she smell like that?

308
23:04.905 --> 23:06.390
Smell?

309
23:06.390 --> 23:09.365
What does Sung Sae Ryeong smell like?

310
23:15.459 --> 23:16.826
A musty smell.

311
23:18.170 --> 23:20.587
Like a grimy old rag.

312
23:20.587 --> 23:21.923
That mustiness.

313
23:23.424 --> 23:24.800
Strange, isn't it?

314
23:24.800 --> 23:28.619
Why would a girl that rich smell like that?

315
23:28.619 --> 23:31.103
And everything she carries is designer.

316
23:33.138 --> 23:37.771
But you know, in this world, there are as many fakes as real ones.

317
23:37.771 --> 23:41.619
You mean everything Sung Sae Ryeong carries is fake?

318
23:41.619 --> 23:44.477
Have you guys ever seen real designer goods?

319
23:45.656 --> 23:47.750
I have.

320
23:47.750 --> 23:50.001
So whose word should you believe?

321
23:50.001 --> 23:52.745
You saw it. We didn't.

322
23:52.745 --> 23:54.039
Right.

323
23:54.039 --> 23:56.639
And there's no proof hers are all knockoffs.

324
23:56.639 --> 23:58.374
Okay.

325
23:58.374 --> 24:01.300
Then I'll just prove it myself, right?

326
24:02.214 --> 24:04.519
Can you prove it?

327
24:04.519 --> 24:07.379
Yeah, it's damn easy.

328
24:11.932 --> 24:14.245
Sae Ryeong.

329
24:15.978 --> 24:17.626
What did you do yesterday?

330
24:17.626 --> 24:18.689
Why?

331
24:18.689 --> 24:20.814
No, nothing.

332
24:20.814 --> 24:23.339
Oh, is your head okay now?

333
24:23.339 --> 24:25.586
Don't worry about it.

334
24:28.864 --> 24:34.620
But Sae Ryeong, you know... you didn't break up with Yu Gyeom, did you?

335
24:34.620 --> 24:37.491
Won Bae said it was just a quick fight. Right?

336
24:37.491 --> 24:39.666
Why do you want to know?

337
24:39.666 --> 24:43.358
No, I just heard a rumor going around.

338
24:43.358 --> 24:47.158
You started that rumor, Kim Jin Mi.

339
24:47.158 --> 24:49.678
What do you mean? Why would I do that?

340
24:49.678 --> 24:51.678
It wasn't me.

341
24:51.678 --> 24:53.023
Right.

342
24:53.023 --> 24:55.508
You'd never do that.

343
25:05.147 --> 25:06.611
Sae Ryeong.

344
25:08.904 --> 25:14.243
- Oh no, what do I do? - What do I do? What do I do about this?

345
25:14.243 --> 25:15.577
What is this?

346
25:15.577 --> 25:19.164
What do I do? Guys, what do I do?

347
25:19.164 --> 25:22.960
Shouldn't you take it in for repairs or something?

348
25:22.960 --> 25:25.594
Right? Must be.

349
25:25.594 --> 25:27.302
Forget it. No need to fix it.

350
25:27.302 --> 25:30.050
No, you have to. You really have to.

351
25:30.050 --> 25:33.303
Sae Ryeong, let's go to the department store after school.

352
25:33.303 --> 25:34.664
I'll pay for repairs.

353
25:34.664 --> 25:37.808
Yeah. There's a department store in Daegu. Let's go today.

354
25:37.808 --> 25:40.206
I said forget it.

355
25:40.206 --> 25:42.897
I bought this abroad, so it can't be repaired here. Forget it.

356
25:42.897 --> 25:45.524
Sae Ryeong, what are you talking about?

357
25:45.524 --> 25:49.905
Luxury brands like this get repaired here even if you bought them abroad.

358
25:49.905 --> 25:52.856
Haven't you heard of a worldwide warranty?

359
25:53.867 --> 25:58.030
You only buy luxury brands, and you really didn't know that?

360
26:00.567 --> 26:02.424
Let's go. Right now. Oh, no!

361
26:02.424 --> 26:05.127
You guys are coming too, right?

362
26:05.127 --> 26:07.411
- Yeah. - Yeah.

363
26:07.411 --> 26:09.731
I can't today. I'm busy.

364
26:09.731 --> 26:13.218
Then we can go tomorrow. Right, Sae Ryeong?

365
26:13.218 --> 26:17.117
The 2811 bus from here takes you right to the department store.

366
26:17.117 --> 26:21.507
Sae Ryeong, promise me we'll take this to the department store tomorrow.

367
26:22.717 --> 26:24.113
Promise.

368
26:49.548 --> 26:51.632
Well, well.

369
26:51.632 --> 26:55.577
Our Yu Gyeom has another great time.

370
26:55.577 --> 26:59.805
Such a useless, great time. That's our Yu Gyeom.

371
27:01.475 --> 27:06.409
I'm tired of doing this every time, too, so can't you just give up now, sir?

372
27:06.409 --> 27:08.357
I gave up ages ago.

373
27:08.357 --> 27:10.819
If a student tells me to give up, then I give up.

374
27:10.819 --> 27:15.598
Good job, Jeong Uk. That's it. Bigger strokes.

375
27:18.339 --> 27:22.224
That was when I was in sixth grade of elementary school.

376
27:23.163 --> 27:26.667
You know, the year your father competed in the Olympics.

377
27:26.667 --> 27:31.200
The whole country was in an uproar back then.

378
27:31.200 --> 27:35.342
Cho Jae Jin placed first in the heats,

379
27:35.342 --> 27:38.659
then first in the main round, and he just kept climbing.

380
27:38.659 --> 27:42.434
When a sport no one expected anything from keeps taking first place,

381
27:42.434 --> 27:44.832
I wonder if you know that thrill.

382
27:45.562 --> 27:48.730
Why would I know a thrill like that?

383
27:48.730 --> 27:52.897
My parents sat in front of the TV at dawn with bloodshot eyes.

384
27:52.897 --> 27:56.905
And it was swimming, not even soccer. I'd never seen them watch like that.

385
27:56.905 --> 28:02.437
But Cho Jae Jin made it to the final and then withdrew.

386
28:02.437 --> 28:06.118
Even though his record so far was enough to win easily.

387
28:09.670 --> 28:11.222
Sit down for a second.

388
28:11.222 --> 28:12.840
Sit, kid.

389
28:17.151 --> 28:21.513
People back then said that Cho Jae Jin had been doping,

390
28:21.513 --> 28:24.170
and ran before a doping test could catch him.

391
28:25.726 --> 28:30.897
He really did retire like that, so the truth never came out.

392
28:30.897 --> 28:35.624
Then, years later, I came to this school as the swim team coach.

393
28:35.624 --> 28:40.492
And our vice principal said to me, "You know Cho Jae Jin, don't you?

394
28:40.492 --> 28:44.202
His son is on our school's swim team."

395
28:44.202 --> 28:46.288
- So? - What do you mean, "so"?

396
28:46.288 --> 28:47.664
So I asked him.

397
28:47.664 --> 28:51.389
"Sir, so what's Cho Jae Jin doing now?"

398
28:51.389 --> 28:55.130
"If his son's on the swim team, is he coaching or something?"

399
28:55.130 --> 28:57.293
"No. He's making soy sauce."

400
28:57.293 --> 28:58.772
Our soy sauce is delicious.

401
28:58.772 --> 28:59.938
Ever tried it?

402
28:59.938 --> 29:01.251
Chestnut rice wine too, right?

403
29:01.251 --> 29:03.407
That's good, too. It sells out nationwide.

404
29:03.407 --> 29:05.682
Want me to steal you one?

405
29:05.682 --> 29:09.644
Still, what made me feel okay was that his son was on our swim team.

406
29:09.644 --> 29:13.199
He wouldn't go off making soy sauce and chestnut rice wine.

407
29:13.199 --> 29:14.566
So I want you to compete--

408
29:14.566 --> 29:16.733
No, I'm going to make it.

409
29:16.733 --> 29:19.605
Tastier, sweeter and nuttier than my dad's.

410
29:19.605 --> 29:21.707
Just shut up.

411
29:22.864 --> 29:24.826
Let me be honest.

412
29:24.826 --> 29:26.411
I've never come in first.

413
29:26.411 --> 29:28.288
So I don't know how winners feel.

414
29:28.288 --> 29:31.752
But I've made plenty of winners.

415
29:31.752 --> 29:35.629
That feels insanely good, too.

416
29:35.629 --> 29:39.243
So how must it feel to actually win?

417
29:40.677 --> 29:42.711
Not my problem.

418
29:47.392 --> 29:50.136
Cho Yu Gyeom, you really plan to keep living like this?

419
29:50.136 --> 29:51.631
Like your dad?

420
29:53.584 --> 29:54.808
Sir.

421
29:55.471 --> 29:57.755
I have three older sisters.

422
29:57.755 --> 29:58.761
Are they pretty?

423
29:59.777 --> 30:01.567
None of them went to college.

424
30:01.567 --> 30:04.102
No, they couldn't.

425
30:04.780 --> 30:05.818
Why?

426
30:06.971 --> 30:08.437
They're girls.

427
30:12.918 --> 30:15.975
That's the kind of family I have, sir. What do you expect?

428
30:15.975 --> 30:17.879
Hey, wait.

429
30:17.879 --> 30:22.673
I wasn't done talking, and he just walks off. He could at least introduce me.

430
30:27.031 --> 30:30.076
Sorry, Jeong Uk. Do one more lap.

431
30:30.076 --> 30:31.391
I didn't get your time.

432
30:31.391 --> 30:32.739
I'm done.

433
30:32.739 --> 30:33.757
Okay, go.

434
30:35.387 --> 30:38.695
Do what I say, you punk. Hurry up and go.

435
30:52.122 --> 30:54.993
The person you're calling isn't answering...

436
30:54.993 --> 30:56.520
Cho Yu Gyeom!

437
31:05.206 --> 31:09.680
Um, hey. You...

438
31:09.680 --> 31:11.643
So...

439
31:11.643 --> 31:14.220
Um. Me? So?

440
31:14.220 --> 31:15.487
What is it?

441
31:15.487 --> 31:18.565
I heard you broke up with Sung Sae Ryeong.

442
31:18.565 --> 31:20.539
So what?

443
31:22.652 --> 31:24.026
Then maybe I could--

444
31:24.026 --> 31:26.033
Hey! Cho Yu Gyeom!

445
31:26.033 --> 31:28.452
Um, over there...

446
31:28.452 --> 31:30.974
S-Sung Sae Ryeong.

447
31:35.003 --> 31:37.544
Oh, Sae Ryeong. What's up?

448
31:37.544 --> 31:40.743
Phew, or is it just me?

449
31:40.743 --> 31:42.699
The weather's...

450
31:44.173 --> 31:45.496
hot.

451
31:47.427 --> 31:50.981
I told you I'd break up with you, right? That I could do that.

452
31:50.981 --> 31:53.475
But I asked you not to tell anyone for now.

453
31:53.475 --> 31:56.427
I said never tell!

454
31:56.427 --> 31:59.487
We broke up. Why can't I say that?

455
31:59.487 --> 32:01.731
Shit, because I'm fucked!

456
32:01.731 --> 32:05.249
No, I'm already fucked, damn it.

457
32:05.249 --> 32:06.381
Cho Yu Gyeom.

458
32:06.381 --> 32:11.305
Everyone knows we broke up. If I walk out of this bathroom, they're all ready to

459
32:12.506 --> 32:15.654
throw shit at me. Do you get it?

460
32:16.486 --> 32:17.738
So?

461
32:19.042 --> 32:20.816
So did they get you?

462
32:21.586 --> 32:23.064
What? Hey.

463
32:23.064 --> 32:24.967
No one's gotten you yet, Sae Ryeong.

464
32:24.967 --> 32:26.549
What do you mean, Yu Gyeom?

465
32:26.549 --> 32:30.380
Even if they did, don't call me.

466
32:31.596 --> 32:34.307
Cho Yu Gyeom! Cho Yu--

467
32:34.307 --> 32:37.746
What? Did you really break up?

468
33:02.294 --> 33:04.987
Sir, please follow that car. Hurry.

469
33:04.987 --> 33:07.253
What if we get caught like this?

470
33:07.253 --> 33:09.707
I told you not to worry about that.

471
33:09.707 --> 33:11.428
I'm still nervous about Sae Ryeong.

472
33:11.428 --> 33:13.626
I said forget it.

473
33:30.272 --> 33:32.560
- Hey. - What?

474
33:33.267 --> 33:35.347
I'm shaking. I don't think I can go.

475
33:35.347 --> 33:38.079
Hold on. It's almost party time.

476
33:38.079 --> 33:39.205
Ryu Si Yeon, you're filming, right?

477
33:39.205 --> 33:41.041
Yeah. I'm filming.

478
33:41.041 --> 33:44.711
But look. Anyone can tell there's no mansion out here.

479
33:44.711 --> 33:47.970
Even when Sae Ryeong lies, she gets caught right away.

480
33:47.970 --> 33:49.783
- Kim Jin Mi. - What?

481
33:51.760 --> 33:54.367
Holy shit, that's insane.

482
33:54.367 --> 33:56.242
Kim Jin Mi.

483
33:56.242 --> 33:57.432
Seriously.

484
33:57.432 --> 33:59.451
No way.

485
33:59.451 --> 34:01.978
Hey, Kim Jin Mi!

486
34:01.978 --> 34:03.632
Hey!

487
34:09.647 --> 34:13.531
Kim Jin Mi, what are you doing?

488
34:13.531 --> 34:15.767
She actually lives here.

489
34:15.767 --> 34:17.617
No, no way.

490
34:17.617 --> 34:20.038
This can't be real. No.

491
34:20.038 --> 34:23.326
See? I told you Sae Ryeong was off.

492
34:23.326 --> 34:26.196
How do you swing and miss this badly?

493
34:27.147 --> 34:29.017
No. This can't be.

494
34:29.017 --> 34:31.216
This is really...

495
34:31.216 --> 34:34.949
Wait here a minute. I'll get you a cold drink.

496
34:34.949 --> 34:36.018
Okay.

497
34:43.686 --> 34:44.784
Let's just go.

498
34:44.784 --> 34:48.067
If Sae Ryeong sees us, we're so screwed.

499
34:48.067 --> 34:49.277
Yeah. Let's hurry up.

500
34:51.230 --> 34:52.909
What are you doing? Come on!

501
34:52.909 --> 34:55.680
Leave her. She's fucking dying to get caught.

502
34:55.680 --> 34:58.993
She must want to get fucking caught and torn to shreds.

503
34:58.993 --> 35:00.447
Ugh, seriously.

504
35:06.675 --> 35:07.710
Thank you.

505
35:07.710 --> 35:10.964
So what brings you here today? It's not your usual day.

506
35:10.964 --> 35:13.753
I can't make it tomorrow, so I came today.

507
35:13.753 --> 35:16.922
Is that so? What a good girl.

508
35:21.599 --> 35:24.519
Kim Jin Mi's blunder was epic.

509
35:24.519 --> 35:30.444
If Sung Sae Ryeong fucking finds out, I'll wreck you first.

510
35:30.444 --> 35:34.520
Sae Ryeong and I are going to the department store tomorrow.

511
35:34.520 --> 35:35.772
Whatever.

512
35:35.772 --> 35:37.147
Let her go.

513
35:37.147 --> 35:41.165
Guess she'll grovel and beg Sae Ryeong for forgiveness.

514
35:41.165 --> 35:44.625
If you ask me, it's not over with Cho Yu Gyeom either.

515
35:44.625 --> 35:47.919
Shit, if Cho Yu Gyeom found out...

516
35:47.919 --> 35:52.033
Her bag is fake. I'll go and prove it.

517
35:52.033 --> 35:54.730
Awesome, epic, let it go.

518
36:46.979 --> 36:49.304
- Boo! - Oh, you scared me!

519
36:52.239 --> 36:54.506
How are you so good at swimming?

520
36:56.528 --> 36:58.200
Do you have air conditioning at home?

521
36:58.200 --> 37:00.609
Yeah, of course.

522
37:01.479 --> 37:03.008
We don't have one.

523
37:03.954 --> 37:05.245
Really?

524
37:05.245 --> 37:06.415
Yeah.

525
37:07.319 --> 37:10.585
No AC, and no computer either.

526
37:10.585 --> 37:12.627
The only TV is in my grandfather's room.

527
37:12.627 --> 37:16.204
And we can't even get internet.

528
37:17.127 --> 37:18.705
No way.

529
37:19.539 --> 37:21.701
So I started swimming.

530
37:22.389 --> 37:24.402
Summers are so hot.

531
37:25.299 --> 37:27.557
At least the sea is cool.

532
37:28.268 --> 37:31.394
That's how I got good at it.

533
37:34.440 --> 37:36.484
So it's a God-given gift?

534
37:36.484 --> 37:40.239
No, I said I got good because it's so hot.

535
37:40.239 --> 37:43.491
Doing it every day doesn't necessarily make it a talent.

536
37:43.491 --> 37:47.215
I study every day, and I'm still bad at it.

537
37:50.099 --> 37:53.933
Didn't your parents say anything when you left today?

538
37:56.359 --> 37:57.833
Kim Ha Yeon!

539
37:58.459 --> 38:00.020
Going out again?

540
38:03.671 --> 38:05.617
Look at you!

541
38:05.617 --> 38:07.517
You still haven't come to your senses.

542
38:07.517 --> 38:09.605
Not one bit.

543
38:09.605 --> 38:14.621
Your brother's torn ear hasn't even healed yet.

544
38:15.734 --> 38:19.506
Mom, I have a boyfriend.

545
38:21.439 --> 38:22.616
What?

546
38:27.159 --> 38:28.390
So?

547
38:29.122 --> 38:31.405
I'm going on a date for a bit.

548
38:35.179 --> 38:36.669
What?

549
38:36.669 --> 38:40.130
A-A date?

550
38:41.090 --> 38:45.637
Mom, I'll never amount to anything, no matter how hard I try.

551
38:45.637 --> 38:49.305
So I decided to be happy, at least today.

552
38:49.305 --> 38:51.200
So I'm going on a date.

553
38:51.200 --> 38:54.109
I won't be too late. See you later.

554
38:56.314 --> 39:00.070
Hey! Kim Ha Yeon!

555
39:00.070 --> 39:01.818
Seriously.

556
39:02.737 --> 39:06.117
What's gotten into her?

557
39:06.117 --> 39:08.104
Why is she acting like that?

558
39:08.954 --> 39:10.650
Ugh, seriously.

559
39:11.537 --> 39:16.503
- Seriously. - My mom isn't someone who changes easily.

560
39:17.479 --> 39:19.569
So I decided to change.

561
39:21.459 --> 39:24.076
That's a good idea.

562
39:24.076 --> 39:26.321
Cool, right?

563
39:30.339 --> 39:31.826
Oh, right.

564
39:31.826 --> 39:33.186
Your mom...

565
39:33.186 --> 39:34.190
Yeah.

566
39:40.027 --> 39:41.259
Yeah. I'm going.

567
39:45.105 --> 39:46.496
Yu Gyeom!

568
39:47.492 --> 39:48.909
Are you okay?

569
39:48.909 --> 39:51.853
I looked everywhere for you.

570
39:55.167 --> 39:57.134
She was really pretty.

571
40:01.798 --> 40:03.218
In my family,

572
40:05.065 --> 40:06.630
only Mom is mine.

573
40:08.847 --> 40:10.438
Lucky you,

574
40:11.458 --> 40:13.413
that Mom is yours.

575
40:18.239 --> 40:19.636
Lucky you, too,

576
40:23.445 --> 40:24.996
that I'm yours.

577
40:26.031 --> 40:27.595
What?

578
40:30.459 --> 40:32.034
What did you say?

579
40:32.034 --> 40:34.534
Say it louder.

580
40:34.534 --> 40:35.830
It's nothing.

581
40:35.830 --> 40:38.958
Say it louder.

582
40:38.958 --> 40:40.993
What?

583
40:40.993 --> 40:43.298
- Say it louder. - No, stop it.

584
40:43.298 --> 40:45.035
I'm really hurt.

585
40:45.035 --> 40:46.883
Hurt? That was hard for me to say.

586
40:46.883 --> 40:48.887
- I want to hear more. - I'm sorry.

587
40:48.887 --> 40:50.789
Tell me more. More.

588
40:56.023 --> 40:59.070
[Death and time] [What is death?]

589
41:01.023 --> 41:02.862
[The sorrow of death] [The house of death]

590
41:07.359 --> 41:09.947
Please check your first-semester grades.

591
41:09.947 --> 41:11.868
Who was top of the class?

592
41:11.868 --> 41:12.950
Isn't it Kim Jung Yeon?

593
41:12.950 --> 41:14.481
No, no. Oh Ji Eun.

594
41:14.481 --> 41:18.938
Yeah. Getting good grades without once opening a book was honestly ridiculous.

595
41:20.294 --> 41:22.917
Seems a bit human, finally.

596
41:24.792 --> 41:27.277
What's it to you guys?

597
41:33.647 --> 41:35.784
[Sign language tutoring]

598
41:37.885 --> 41:39.659
What are you doing? Still up?

599
41:39.659 --> 41:41.659
Mom, I'm going to sleep.

600
41:42.939 --> 41:44.776
Good night, Mom.

601
41:44.776 --> 41:49.833
By the way, what did you and that boy talk about yesterday?

602
41:51.885 --> 41:53.699
No.

603
41:53.699 --> 41:55.330
Nothing.

604
41:55.330 --> 41:56.793
Don't tell me...

605
41:58.758 --> 42:02.323
You haven't fallen for him already, have you?

606
42:02.323 --> 42:05.795
No. That's not it. No.

607
42:05.795 --> 42:09.578
Sam Hee, your face says it all.

608
42:09.578 --> 42:11.605
No, Mom. It's not like that.

609
42:11.605 --> 42:18.432
He wants me to teach him sign language, so I got a little flustered.

610
42:18.432 --> 42:19.483
I really mean it.

611
42:19.483 --> 42:23.831
Really? Then you can teach him.

612
42:23.831 --> 42:28.109
But you can just learn sign language from videos or something, so...

613
42:28.109 --> 42:31.132
But he asked you to teach him, right?

614
42:31.132 --> 42:36.206
So you can teach him and earn pocket money,

615
42:37.652 --> 42:40.440
and spend time with someone you like.

616
42:41.708 --> 42:43.768
- Two birds with one stone. - No, Mom.

617
42:43.768 --> 42:46.242
No, no. I really don't like him.

618
42:46.242 --> 42:48.880
Come on, I only met him yesterday.

619
42:48.880 --> 42:53.341
It was just such a sudden offer that I got flustered.

620
42:56.135 --> 42:58.410
Right. You don't like him.

621
42:58.410 --> 42:59.746
Yet.

622
42:59.746 --> 43:03.831
Mom, it's really not like that.

623
43:03.831 --> 43:07.944
Okay, since you don't like him, just give it a try.

624
43:07.944 --> 43:14.695
It's bothered me, too, seeing you stuck in the kitchen at such a pretty age.

625
43:14.695 --> 43:18.743
Use teaching him as an excuse to get out a bit, okay?

626
43:18.743 --> 43:22.784
Eat something tasty, see something fun.

627
43:22.784 --> 43:24.042
Wouldn't that be nice?

628
43:24.042 --> 43:27.118
Grandpa does all that for me anyway.

629
43:28.912 --> 43:30.220
True.

630
43:32.548 --> 43:36.888
But Grandpa doesn't give you butterflies. Am I right?

631
43:36.888 --> 43:39.371
It's really not like that, Mom.

632
43:39.371 --> 43:44.214
Do you have to like someone to get butterflies? Meeting someone new does it too.

633
43:44.214 --> 43:47.272
Why were you staring at your phone all day?

634
43:47.272 --> 43:49.564
It's not him. It's my other friends.

635
43:49.564 --> 43:52.222
What are you looking at, Mom?

636
44:02.970 --> 44:05.812
I'm sorry, honey.

637
44:06.777 --> 44:09.320
I'm sorry.

638
44:10.291 --> 44:14.514
I take back what I said,

639
44:16.758 --> 44:21.811
that you'll never amount to anything, no matter how hard you try.

640
44:21.811 --> 44:23.806
I'm sorry, sweetheart.

641
44:26.227 --> 44:30.022
So can you please stop this now?

642
44:30.022 --> 44:32.200
I'm not asking for much.

643
44:32.200 --> 44:34.443
Just go back to how things were.

644
44:34.443 --> 44:37.613
Let's just live the way we used to.

645
44:37.613 --> 44:39.618
Okay, Ha Yeon?

646
44:39.618 --> 44:41.200
Can you do that for me?

647
44:41.200 --> 44:44.123
I'll never make that mistake...

648
44:46.958 --> 44:48.326
Wait right there.

649
44:48.326 --> 44:50.528
I'm not done talking.

650
44:51.311 --> 44:52.971
Yes, hello?

651
44:56.718 --> 45:01.225
Yes, what's this about?

652
45:01.811 --> 45:04.125
Yes.

653
45:16.051 --> 45:17.576
What?

654
45:17.576 --> 45:19.037
You think this is funny?

655
45:19.825 --> 45:22.451
No, it's not funny.

656
45:22.451 --> 45:23.923
Then why are you laughing?

657
45:25.024 --> 45:26.916
Because you're funny.

658
45:27.531 --> 45:28.728
Me?

659
45:30.264 --> 45:34.284
"Mom, I have a boyfriend."

660
45:34.284 --> 45:36.466
Seriously.

661
45:36.466 --> 45:37.974
Stop it.

662
45:38.760 --> 45:42.903
"Mom, I'm going out on a date for a bit."

663
45:42.903 --> 45:44.528
I said stop it.

664
45:44.528 --> 45:47.975
"Mom, I've decided to live my own life."

665
45:47.975 --> 45:49.367
So annoying.

666
45:49.367 --> 45:50.522
"So annoying."

667
45:50.522 --> 45:53.172
Are you crazy? Seriously, stop.

668
45:54.148 --> 45:56.236
- Stop it. I mean it. - Nice.

669
45:56.236 --> 46:00.725
I said stop! What's so nice about it? Hurry up and eat. Seriously.

670
46:02.701 --> 46:04.851
Stop staring at me. Seriously.

671
46:04.851 --> 46:08.801
Do that one more time and I'll hit you. I mean it. I really mean it.

672
46:23.844 --> 46:27.637
Sae Ryeong, you remember we're going to the department store today, right?

673
46:27.637 --> 46:29.934
Forget it. I'll just throw the bag out.

674
46:29.934 --> 46:32.647
Why throw away something so expensive?

675
46:32.647 --> 46:36.109
Then just give it to me. I'll use it.

676
46:36.109 --> 46:37.277
What are you doing?

677
46:37.277 --> 46:39.735
If you can't give it away, sell it to me.

678
46:39.735 --> 46:42.696
I can take it to the store and fix it.

679
46:42.696 --> 46:43.751
How much was it?

680
46:43.751 --> 46:46.011
- This was about-- - Okay, fine.

681
46:47.851 --> 46:48.909
You'll sell it to me?

682
46:48.909 --> 46:52.304
No, I said let's go to the department store.

683
46:53.951 --> 46:55.051
Okay, then later--

684
46:55.051 --> 46:56.514
Why wait until later?

685
46:56.514 --> 46:58.391
If we're going, go now.

686
46:58.391 --> 46:59.647
Class is about to--

687
46:59.647 --> 47:02.188
Since when do we care about supplementary class?

688
47:02.188 --> 47:03.897
I'm leaving now.

689
47:03.897 --> 47:05.492
Come if you want.

690
47:05.492 --> 47:06.786
If not, whatever.

691
47:08.124 --> 47:10.098
Sae Ryeong, wait for me.

692
47:32.663 --> 47:35.326
This one's new for fall and winter.

693
47:35.326 --> 47:37.710
Only two have come into Korea.

694
47:37.710 --> 47:40.105
And this one is a staple of our store.

695
47:40.105 --> 47:44.782
It's the one our customers ask for most, and it just came in this morning.

696
47:46.191 --> 47:47.576
Can I try this one?

697
47:47.576 --> 47:49.565
Of course.

698
47:58.191 --> 48:00.284
It looks so good on you.

699
48:04.317 --> 48:07.075
Sae Ryeong, I said we'd get your bag fixed.

700
48:07.075 --> 48:09.970
I'm just going to buy a new one.

701
48:13.331 --> 48:15.771
I don't have that kind of money.

702
48:15.771 --> 48:17.261
I know.

703
48:17.261 --> 48:18.696
Someone like you wouldn't.

704
48:19.771 --> 48:20.868
How much is this?

705
48:20.868 --> 48:23.833
It's 6,822,000 won.

706
48:25.091 --> 48:26.991
- I'll take it. - Shall I ring it up?

707
48:26.991 --> 48:28.512
Yes, please.

708
48:31.151 --> 48:32.367
Then how much should I...

709
48:32.367 --> 48:33.903
Forget it.

710
48:33.903 --> 48:36.104
I'm letting you off the hook.

711
48:36.104 --> 48:37.418
What did you say?

712
48:38.273 --> 48:39.563
Installments?

713
48:39.563 --> 48:40.596
In full.

714
48:40.596 --> 48:42.186
Okay.

715
48:42.186 --> 48:44.443
I'm the one letting you off the hook.

716
48:44.443 --> 48:49.146
So I hope you'll keep your head down in your place like always.

717
48:51.082 --> 48:53.991
Ma'am, do you have anything else?

718
48:56.375 --> 49:01.958
Kim Jin Mi, you've got it all wrong. She's buying it. And paying in full.

719
49:06.343 --> 49:08.576
She'll buy it and return it for sure.

720
49:08.576 --> 49:11.684
She'll take it home and return it as is.

721
49:15.356 --> 49:18.852
- Ma'am, just take off all the tags. - Pardon?

722
49:18.852 --> 49:21.855
Then it'll be hard to exchange or refund it.

723
49:21.855 --> 49:23.284
I don't do that.

724
49:23.284 --> 49:25.248
I'd rather buy a new one.

725
49:28.147 --> 49:29.534
What?

726
49:29.534 --> 49:31.689
What's with that look?

727
49:31.689 --> 49:33.647
Nothing, Sae Ryeong.

728
49:33.647 --> 49:36.453
You guys, is there anything you want?

729
49:36.453 --> 49:38.576
Should I buy you something while we're here?

730
49:38.576 --> 49:40.282
Really?

731
49:40.282 --> 49:43.362
That'd be awesome.

732
49:45.254 --> 49:48.578
You should just admit it too.

733
49:48.578 --> 49:52.260
Sae Ryeong won't crumble over whatever you say or do.

734
49:56.756 --> 49:58.784
Isn't this color pretty?

735
49:58.784 --> 50:00.314
Yeah, it suits you.

736
50:04.122 --> 50:06.659
Kim Jin Mi, I heard you blew it again?

737
50:06.659 --> 50:08.736
How long can you keep up the fucking lies?

738
50:08.736 --> 50:11.447
See you at school tomorrow.

739
50:11.447 --> 50:15.534
Look. The more you act up, the deeper you dig your own hole.

740
50:15.534 --> 50:17.995
Was I the only one who hated Sae Ryeong?

741
50:17.995 --> 50:20.250
You all hated her guts, too.

742
50:20.250 --> 50:23.968
But Jin Mi, I'm saying now's not the moment.

743
50:24.647 --> 50:27.430
And maybe that moment will never come.

744
50:28.213 --> 50:30.897
Sae Ryeong has power.

745
50:30.897 --> 50:33.605
So just keep your head down, like Sae Ryeong said.

746
50:33.605 --> 50:36.986
You know what happens if you cross the queen.

747
50:40.731 --> 50:42.576
Anyway, this is so pretty.

748
50:42.576 --> 50:44.272
Luxury brands are different, right?

749
50:44.272 --> 50:45.617
So you're cool-toned?

750
50:45.617 --> 50:47.061
How'd you know?

751
50:48.355 --> 50:49.615
Ha Yeon.

752
50:58.096 --> 50:59.300
Want to ride with me?

753
51:03.260 --> 51:07.005
No. I'll just walk.

754
51:07.005 --> 51:08.679
Come on, ride with me.

755
51:12.564 --> 51:14.173
- Yeah? - Yeah.

756
51:15.563 --> 51:16.914
I'll come back.

757
51:18.856 --> 51:20.560
- Should I go? - Yeah.

758
51:20.560 --> 51:21.993
Okay, I'm going.

759
51:21.993 --> 51:23.045
See you later.

760
51:23.045 --> 51:24.206
Yeah.

761
51:26.223 --> 51:29.043
- What are you doing? Go. - It won't go forward.

762
51:29.043 --> 51:31.497
Go, hurry. Go.

763
51:33.623 --> 51:35.456
- See you. - Yeah.

764
51:44.710 --> 51:47.200
Yeah. Heel down, then toe.

765
51:47.200 --> 51:50.656
Heel down, then toe. Faster.

766
51:51.380 --> 51:53.117
Why can't you get it?

767
51:53.117 --> 51:54.174
Isn't this right?

768
51:54.174 --> 51:55.689
- Got it. - I said heel, toe.

769
51:55.689 --> 51:58.764
- Got it. - Heel, toe. You have to be quick.

770
52:03.589 --> 52:04.775
Sae Ryeong.

771
52:06.273 --> 52:07.812
Sae Ryeong!

772
52:09.455 --> 52:11.066
Where's Kim Jin Mi?

773
52:11.066 --> 52:12.343
No idea.

774
52:12.343 --> 52:15.904
Sae Ryeong, the tint you got me is so pretty.

775
52:15.904 --> 52:18.480
- Oh, really? - I'm wearing it again today.

776
52:18.480 --> 52:20.534
What? I'm wearing it, too.

777
52:20.534 --> 52:22.134
Why are you copying me?

778
52:23.053 --> 52:27.147
Sae Ryeong, what does your grandpa do?

779
52:27.147 --> 52:28.804
My grandpa?

780
52:29.463 --> 52:31.565
They've both passed away.

781
52:32.272 --> 52:34.064
- Really? - Yeah.

782
52:34.064 --> 52:37.843
There's an old lady at my house, but she works for us.

783
52:37.843 --> 52:41.722
My mom says I can never be alone with a man, even an old grandpa.

784
52:41.722 --> 52:44.897
You know, political families are conservative.

785
52:55.829 --> 52:58.034
Who are you?

786
52:58.034 --> 53:00.142
Hello, sir.

787
53:09.291 --> 53:11.960
Got a haircut, and...

788
53:11.960 --> 53:16.205
Seriously, it's insane. Where is it? I saw it.

789
53:16.205 --> 53:17.284
What is it? Let me see.

790
53:17.284 --> 53:20.059
It's fucking hilarious. Look.

791
53:25.814 --> 53:27.647
Going to the bathroom real quick.

792
53:27.647 --> 53:29.547
Me too. I'll come with you.

793
53:44.983 --> 53:48.242
You mean that girl Sae Ryeong, right?

794
53:48.242 --> 53:49.703
Yes.

795
53:49.703 --> 53:53.936
She's the one who mops our villa's floors.

796
53:53.936 --> 53:55.638
Mopping the floors?

797
53:56.296 --> 54:01.970
Well, she lives at the foot of that mountain with her grandma.

798
54:01.970 --> 54:04.760
She's such a good kid.

799
54:05.556 --> 54:12.020
She comes by our villa now and then to mop and clean for me.

800
54:12.020 --> 54:15.921
She can see it's hard for me to manage the villa alone.

801
54:15.921 --> 54:18.357
She helps me out so much.

802
54:19.072 --> 54:21.783
So you're not related to Sae Ryeong, sir?

803
54:21.783 --> 54:24.224
- That's insane. - It was all a big lie?

804
54:24.224 --> 54:25.829
Complete strangers.

805
54:25.829 --> 54:29.495
But she works so hard to help me out.

806
54:31.084 --> 54:32.567
Whose villa is it?

807
54:32.567 --> 54:34.514
- That's insane. - Shh.

808
54:35.756 --> 54:38.839
Did you guys see?

809
54:38.839 --> 54:40.257
We're watching right now.

810
54:40.257 --> 54:41.679
Is it Sae Ryeong's father?

811
54:41.679 --> 54:43.326
What?

812
54:43.326 --> 54:46.263
I told you, she lives down that mountain with her grandma.

813
54:46.263 --> 54:49.231
She has a really hard life.

814
55:10.746 --> 55:15.897
Sung Sae Ryeong, I still want to give you at least a little money.

815
55:15.897 --> 55:18.231
To pay for that bag, I mean.

816
55:18.231 --> 55:21.500
So, can you come to the rooftop for a sec?

817
55:37.333 --> 55:38.756
So?

818
55:39.593 --> 55:41.857
So what am I supposed to do?

819
55:41.857 --> 55:44.909
Sae Ryeong asked to talk for a minute.

820
55:45.533 --> 55:46.834
And you...

821
55:47.532 --> 55:49.006
believe that?

822
55:53.153 --> 55:54.214
Yeah.

823
55:55.733 --> 55:59.316
Because when I'm with you, I'm not scared at all.

824
56:01.758 --> 56:03.625
So you want me to go with you?

825
56:06.293 --> 56:08.113
Could you do that?

826
56:10.073 --> 56:11.577
Okay, let's go.

827
56:22.317 --> 56:23.492
What is this?

828
56:23.492 --> 56:26.238
Mop water from the bathroom. What else?

829
56:26.238 --> 56:32.269
Even if it's out that Sae Ryeong's broke, don't you think you're going too far?

830
56:32.269 --> 56:34.663
Seo Gyeong, was it ninth grade for you?

831
56:34.663 --> 56:38.273
That bald spot from one wrong word to Cho Yu Gyeom.

832
56:38.273 --> 56:40.881
You still have it, don't you?

833
56:40.881 --> 56:44.633
Somewhere on the back of your head, like an idiot.

834
56:45.856 --> 56:47.953
You guys are so nice.

835
56:47.953 --> 56:51.108
Is it because you're country kids? How are you so nice?

836
56:54.453 --> 56:58.919
Guys, that bitch Sung Sae Ryeong is nothing now.

837
56:59.546 --> 57:02.733
No Cho Yu Gyeom going crazy when someone touches her,

838
57:02.733 --> 57:07.673
and no parents rushing over to raise hell. Fuck, she never had any to begin with.

839
57:07.673 --> 57:11.950
Her grandma can't even talk. She can't hear, either. Isn't that crazy?

840
57:11.950 --> 57:14.147
So what can we do now?

841
57:14.147 --> 57:15.784
Like she did to us...

842
57:21.046 --> 57:23.063
I'm on my way.

843
57:24.341 --> 57:27.596
We have to pay her back, don't we?

844
57:40.353 --> 57:45.144
What if I had just died back then?

845
57:49.726 --> 57:51.864
Would Yu Gyeom have regretted it?

846
57:57.874 --> 57:59.970
Kim Ha Yeon would go to prison.

847
58:15.572 --> 58:17.154
I'll do it.

848
58:31.433 --> 58:33.770
Wouldn't it actually be better

849
58:34.411 --> 58:36.153
with just me gone?

850
58:39.539 --> 58:41.960
Why did I survive?

851
58:44.159 --> 58:47.084
Why did I end up surviving?

852
59:22.668 --> 59:26.063
Must be fun, the way you're all laughing.

853
59:33.093 --> 59:34.279
Who was it?

854
59:43.833 --> 59:45.682
I said, who was it!

855
59:51.633 --> 59:52.789
Was it you?

856
59:53.393 --> 59:55.117
Was it you? Kim Jin Mi, answer.

857
59:55.117 --> 59:58.245
- It's not that... - Answer me!

858
59:58.245 --> 01:00:01.493
Even with no dad and a mom who ran off,

859
01:00:02.386 --> 01:00:04.963
why am I so pretty and beautiful,

860
01:00:06.199 --> 01:00:09.668
when my heart is so utterly ugly?

861
01:00:11.906 --> 01:00:13.220
Goodbye.

862
01:00:14.499 --> 01:00:16.765
I couldn't be the only one to die.

863
01:00:17.533 --> 01:00:19.855
So all of us, together,

864
01:00:21.310 --> 01:00:22.600
die.
